<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>API Changelog</title>
    <style>

        * {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        
        .title {
            margin: 1em 0 0.5em 0;
            font-size: 36px;
        }

        .path {
            color: #016BF8;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .endpoint {
            color: #21313c;
            line-height: 24px;
            margin: 22px 0;
        }        

        .endpoint-header {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
        }

        .change-type {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 16px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            height: 18px;
            padding-left: 6px;
            padding-right: 6px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border: 1px solid;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            background-color: #E3FCF7;
            border-color: #C0FAE6;
            color: #00684A;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .change {
        }

        .breaking {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
            margin-right: 5px;
        }

        .breaking-icon {
            color: #DB3030;
        }

        .section-title {
            margin: 1.5em 0 0.5em 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #21313c;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e8edeb;
            padding-bottom: 0.25em;
            text-transform: capitalize;
        }

        .tooltip {
            position:relative;  
        }

        .tooltip:before {
            content: attr(data-text);  
            position:absolute;

             
            top:50%;
            transform:translateY(-50%);

             
            left:100%;
            margin-left:15px;  

             
            width:200px;
            padding:10px;
            border-radius:10px;
            background:#000;
            color: #fff;
            text-align:center;

            display:none;  
        }        

        .tooltip:hover:before {
            display:block;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="title">API Changelog v1 vs. v1</div>
    

    

    

    
    
    <div class="section-title">API Changes</div>
    
    <div class="endpoint">
        <div class="endpoint-header">
            <span class="path">PUT /owners/{ownerId}/pets</span>
            <div class="change-type">Updated</div>
        </div>
        
    <ul class="endpoint-changes">
        
        <li class="change">
        
        <div class="breaking tooltip" data-text="Breaking Change">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="breaking-icon" role="img" aria-label="Important With Circle Icon"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8 15A7 7 0 1 0 8 1a7 7 0 0 0 0 14ZM7 4.5a1 1 0 0 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4Zm2 7a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
        </div>
        
        api removed without deprecation
        </li>
        
    </ul>
    
    </div>
    
    <div class="endpoint">
        <div class="endpoint-header">
            <span class="path">POST /pets/{petId}</span>
            <div class="change-type">Updated</div>
        </div>
        
    <ul class="endpoint-changes">
        
        <li class="change">
        
        <div class="breaking tooltip" data-text="Breaking Change">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="breaking-icon" role="img" aria-label="Important With Circle Icon"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8 15A7 7 0 1 0 8 1a7 7 0 0 0 0 14ZM7 4.5a1 1 0 0 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4Zm2 7a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
        </div>
        
        the request property `items/Ünïcode/price` became required
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        <div class="breaking tooltip" data-text="Breaking Change">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="breaking-icon" role="img" aria-label="Important With Circle Icon"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8 15A7 7 0 1 0 8 1a7 7 0 0 0 0 14ZM7 4.5a1 1 0 0 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4Zm2 7a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
        </div>
        
        removed the request property `items/Ünïcode/price/%20`
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        <div class="breaking tooltip" data-text="Breaking Change">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="breaking-icon" role="img" aria-label="Important With Circle Icon"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8 15A7 7 0 1 0 8 1a7 7 0 0 0 0 14ZM7 4.5a1 1 0 0 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4Zm2 7a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
        </div>
        
        removed the request property `items/Ünïcode/price/&amp;anchor`
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        the request optional property `items/Ünïcode/price` became write-only
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        removed the deprecated request property `items/Ünïcode/price/id`
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        the `items/Ünïcode/price` request property `type` changed from `object` to `string` (backward compatible)
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        the response optional property `no/items/price` became write-only for the status `204` (media type: application/xml)
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        the response optional property `price` became write-only for the status `204` (media type: application/json; charset=utf-8)
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        the response property `no/items/price` became required for the status `204` (media type: application/xml)
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        the `no/items/price` response&#39;s property `type` changed from `object` to `string` for status `204` (media type: application/xml)
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        the `price` response&#39;s property `type` changed from `object` to `string` for status `204` (media type: application/json; charset=utf-8)
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        removed the deprecated required property `no/items/price/id` from the response with the `204` status (media type: application/xml)
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        removed the deprecated required property `price/id` from the response with the `204` status (media type: application/json; charset=utf-8)
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        removed the required write-only property `no/items/price/%20` from the response with the `204` status (media type: application/xml)
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        removed the required write-only property `no/items/price/&amp;anchor` from the response with the `204` status (media type: application/xml)
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        removed the required write-only property `price/%20` from the response with the `204` status (media type: application/json; charset=utf-8)
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        removed the required write-only property `price/&amp;anchor` from the response with the `204` status (media type: application/json; charset=utf-8)
        </li>
        
        <li class="change">
        
        the response write-only property `price` became required for the status `204` (media type: application/json; charset=utf-8)
        </li>
        
    </ul>
    
    </div>
    
    

    
    
</body>

</html>

